// FUNCTION: BFME2 0x0048337A size=114 name=?newWorkerRespawnProcess@RebuildHoleBehavior@@QAEXPAVObject@@@Z evidence=N:ledger
void RebuildHoleBehavior::newWorkerRespawnProcess(Object *oldWorker)
{
	const RebuildHoleBehaviorModuleData *data = (const RebuildHoleBehaviorModuleData *)getModuleData();
	Object *hole = getObject();
	if (oldWorker)
		TheGameLogic->destroyObject(oldWorker);
	m_workerID = INVALID_ID;
	m_workerWaitCounter = (UnsignedInt)data->m_workerRespawnDelay;
	hole->maskObject(false);
	hole->rva0028CDEB(Rva00391F4E(0, 3, 0x3C), false);
	hole->setSelectable(true);
	TheAI->pathfinder()->AddObjectToPathfindMap(hole);
}

